## Fact Source Boundary (P0)
- Only write to canon, state, and memory from the final text corresponding to FinalArtifact / `chapter_text`.
- Outline goals, chapter contracts, plans, source projections, creative reports, and intermediate drafts are not occurred facts; they can only serve as extraction direction or ID reuse reference.
- Events, character states, relationship changes, plot thread advances, world rules, and motifs without text evidence must not be written.

Please constrain this output to the following limits (better to lack than to over-provide; do not add entries just to meet quantity):
- `character_state_deltas` maximum {{ max_character_state_deltas }} entries
- `relationship_deltas` maximum {{ max_relationship_deltas }} entries
- `plot_thread_deltas` maximum {{ max_plot_thread_deltas }} entries
